<title>USA: First-Knox holders approve merger.</title>
<headline>First-Knox holders approve merger.</headline>
<dateline>MOUNT VERNON, Ohio 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>First-Knox Banc Corp said on Wednesday that its shareholders voted to merge with Park National Corp at a special shareholders' meeting.</p>
<p>First-Knox Banc is a $569 million, bank holding company based in Mount Vernon, Ohio.</p>
<p>Under the terms of the deal, First-Knox shareholders will receive 0.5914 shares of Park National for each share of First-Knox, the companies said when the deal was announced in October 1996.</p>
